MedRAX (vendored at apps/api/services/medagent)
-----------------------------------------------
This repository vendors a copy of MedRAX, a medical reasoning agent for chest
X-ray interpretation built on LangGraph.

  Project:  MedRAX
  Source:   https://github.com/bowang-lab/MedRAX
  Authors:  Adibvafa Fallahpour, Jun Ma, Alif Munim, Hongwei Lyu,
            Bo Wang, et al. (Bowang Lab, University of Toronto / Vector Institute)
  Paper:    "MedRAX: Medical Reasoning Agent for Chest X-ray"
            ICML 2025. arXiv:2502.02673
  License:  Apache License 2.0
            (retained verbatim at apps/api/services/medagent/LICENSE)

The MedRAX source under apps/api/services/medagent/ is the property of its
original authors and is redistributed here under the Apache License 2.0. The
PulmoCare MIT license does NOT relicense this component. See CITATION.cff for
the recommended academic citation.

MedRAX in turn integrates and/or invokes additional third-party models and
libraries, each governed by its own license and (where applicable) data-use
agreement, including but not limited to:

  - LLaVA / LLaVA-Med           (model weights, separate license)
  - CheXagent / CheXbench       (Stanford AIMI, separate terms)
  - TorchXRayVision             (Apache-2.0)
  - MAIRA-2 / report models     (IAMJB chexpert-mimic-cxr baselines, HF Hub)
  - MIMIC-CXR, CheXpert         (datasets, restricted PhysioNet / Stanford DUAs)
  - LangChain / LangGraph       (MIT)
  - Hugging Face Transformers   (Apache-2.0)

None of the above model weights or datasets are distributed with this
repository. Users are responsible for obtaining them under their respective
licenses and for complying with all applicable data-use agreements.

